&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are: &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SpotHero, we work as a team to empower people to get everywhere, easier! We’re rapidly growing with the mission of bringing the parking industry into the future through technology. Drivers across the nation use the SpotHero mobile app or website to reserve convenient, affordable parking in advance, on-the-go or through their connected cars, and parking companies rely on us to help them reach new customers while optimizing their business. We connect the dots with cutting-edge technology, delivering value to both sides of this exciting, evolving marketplace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Affiliate Marketing Specialist (Contractor):&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Affiliate Marketing Specialist is a role on our Business Development team that will lead the daily execution of affiliate marketing programs under the leadership of the Affiliate Marketing Manager. This will include distribution channels like: publishers through Rakuten, card linked offers, and recurring annual events like marathons, festivals, etc. The role will ensure that SpotHero can meet customers where they’re at and embed parking in other consumer digital experiences and related offers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a 9 month contract with the potential to convert to FT. The Hourly Rate is $35/hr.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop expertise in SpotHero&#39;s affiliate link syntax and apply it across affiliate marketing and business development initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Test and validate affiliate links for accuracy and quality before distributing them to partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Marketing on content and creative assets development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and oversee the implementation of third-party partnerships for individual events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with planning, tracking, organizing, and executing affiliate campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support partner communications, relationship management, and outreach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re comfortable working in spreadsheets, analyzing data and generating insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re detail oriented, don’t let things slip through the cracks, can manage lots of little details across multiple programs simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re a strong communicator, able to work well x-functionally and serve in a partner management capacity externally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re type-A, extremely organized, always on top of things&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re willing to learn and master certain software and platforms that are used to execute affiliate programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in hands on execution of affiliate marketing programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are offering:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A workplace recognized as &lt;a href=&quot;https://1871.com/1871-news-and-content/1871-momentum-awards-winners-2023/&quot;&gt;CityLights award winner &lt;/a&gt;by 1871, &lt;a href=&quot;https://builtin.com/awards/chicago/2026/best-midsize-places-to-work#spothero&quot;&gt;2026 Best Places To Work &lt;/a&gt;by BuiltIn, &lt;a href=&quot;https://mostlovedworkplace.com/companies/spothero/&quot;&gt;Most Loved Workplace Certified&lt;/a&gt; by the Best Practice Institute, and recipient of multiple Comparably awards, including &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.comparably.com/companies/spothero&quot;&gt;Best Company Culture, Best Company for Women, and Best Company for Diversity.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SpotHero, we&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Respect Fellow Drivers&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;by providing an inclusive interview experience for everyone, including people with disabilities. We are happy to provide reasonable accommodations to candidates in need of individualized support during the hiring process. Please let our team know of your need when you apply or as you begin interviewing with our team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SpotHero is an equal opportunity employer. We know that a diverse workforce is the strongest workforce, and are committed to building and supporting an inclusive environment for all.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PLEASE NOTE: This position is ineligible for visa sponsorship.&amp;nbsp; To be considered for this role, you must be legally authorized to work in the US and not require sponsorship for employment now or in the future.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SpotHero, we work as a team to empower people to get everywhere, easier! We’re rapidly growing with the mission of bringing the parking industry into the future through technology. Drivers across the nation use the SpotHero mobile app and website to reserve convenient, affordable parking in advance, on-the-go or through their connected cars, and parking companies rely on us to help them reach new customers while optimizing their business. We connect the dots with cutting-edge technology, delivering value to both sides of this exciting, evolving marketplace. We’ve been quite busy, take a peek at some of our recent&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://spothero.com/press/&quot;&gt;announcements&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Digital Marketing Specialist II at SpotHero&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SpotHero is seeking a Digital Marketing Specialist II, to support the digital marketing team in planning, implementing, and optimizing digital marketing campaigns across multiple channels. Focused on user acquisition, collaborate with SpotHero’s broader marketing team on our acquisition marketing strategy and execute multi-channel, direct response digital campaigns that drive business growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will get to do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own day-to-day execution and optimization of SEM campaigns with increasing autonomy across Google Ads, Microsoft Ads, and Apple Search Ads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently launch, QA, and manage new campaigns, ad groups, and keyword builds using established frameworks and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze campaign performance and provide actionable insights that inform weekly optimization plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct keyword research, maintain keyword hygiene, and proactively identify new targeting or segmentation opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support development and execution of SEM testing roadmaps, including ad copy tests, bidding strategies, and audience experiments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify issues or inefficiencies in campaign structure, budget pacing, tracking, or performance, escalating when appropriate and proposing solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide and present reports and actionable insights with minimal guidance to inform campaign optimizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams (Sales, Finance, Analysts) to support measurement improvements and campaign initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document processes and contribute to workflow improvements that increase team efficiency and scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If applicable - serve as a resource to SEM Specialist I team members by sharing learnings, reviewing work, or helping troubleshoot execution tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are Data-Driven - Your attention to detail is unparalleled. You are obsessed with campaign performance and driving results, but you also use data to uncover impactful customer and/or financial insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are Analytical - Your strong quantitative skills lend to creative and effective problem solving. You should be familiar with big data and how to make sense of it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are Inquisitive - You are innovative, resourceful, and naturally curious. You ask the right questions and are constantly looking for ways to improve upon things.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a Team Player - you work with multiple individuals to complete a task or achieve a goal. You bring people along with you and they trust you with substantial budgets.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are willing to evolve your point of view to align with changing business climate, technical methods, and team needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or equivalent with 2+ years experience in digital marketing, paid search, and/or paid social media&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Google Ads, Microsoft Advertising/Bing Ads, Apple Search Ads, or similar platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-depth understanding of Paid Search campaign management and optimization practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills: experience with reporting and data analysis, including pivot tables, Excel formulas, and data manipulation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in a data-driven marketing environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated understanding of SEM best practices and tactics for driving growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You may also have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with CTV and/or mobile app marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Certifications for: Google Ads, Bing Ads/Microsoft Advertising, Apple Search Ads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical skills related to Data/SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Seeking Candidates in:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Chicago, Illinois&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are offering:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career game changer – A truly unique experience to work for a fast-growing company in a role with unlimited growth potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We cover a generous portion of Medical Premiums, 50% of Dental and Vision Premiums, company-sponsored Life Insurance, STD, and AD&amp;amp;D coverage, a 401(k) with match and immediate vesting, and comprehensive leave policies to meet your needs in creating space for life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible PTO policy and outstanding work/life balance – We value and support each individual team member.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;UberEats weekly lunch stipend for in-office days&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Udemy License and Personal Learning Budget – We support the professional and personal growth of our people by providing everyone with learning resources and development opportunities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual parking stipend – Duh. We help people park!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to collaborate with fun, innovative, and passionate people in a casual yet highly productive atmosphere.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our commitment to allyship has been a central driver of how we Respect Fellow Drivers. You’ll have the opportunity to be part of Employee Resource Groups, access allyship learning resources, and actively contribute to our ongoing effort of making SpotHero inclusive for all.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee programs to grow and support our people such as Discovery Days for Product and Engineering, Gearing up for Aspiring Leaders, and Mentorship Program.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellness program – a workplace that actively supports your physical and mental wellbeing through ongoing events, initiatives, resources, and thoughtful perks and benefits.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A workplace recognized as&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://1871.com/1871-news-and-content/1871-momentum-awards-winners-2023/&quot;&gt;CityLights award winner&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;by 1871,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://builtin.com/awards/chicago/2026/best-midsize-places-to-work#spothero&quot;&gt;2026 Best Places To Work&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;by BuiltIn,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://mostlovedworkplace.com/companies/spothero/&quot;&gt;Most Loved Workplace Certified&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;by the Best Practice Institute, and recipient of multiple Comparably awards, including&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.comparably.com/companies/spothero&quot;&gt;Best Company Culture, Best Company for Women, and Best Company for Diversity.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation in Illinois&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Depending on your skillset and experience, you can expect your base salary to be between $62,560 - $78,200 as well as a discretionary bonus, and leading total rewards package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SpotHero, we Respect Fellow Drivers by providing an inclusive interview experience for everyone, including people with disabilities. We are happy to provide reasonable accommodations to candidates in need of individualized support during the hiring process. Please let our team know of your need when you apply or as you begin interviewing with our team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SpotHero is an equal opportunity employer. We know that a diverse workforce is the strongest workforce, and are committed to building and supporting an inclusive environment for all.Additionally, because we want to Remember to Signal, if you choose to provide us personal information in connection with a job application, please review our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://spothero.com/legal/applicant-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Applicant Privacy Notice&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;which provides details about what information we collect and process about you in order to consider your candidacy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PLEASE NOTE: This position is ineligible for visa sponsorship. To be considered for this role, you must be legally authorized to work in the US and not require sponsorship for employment now or in the future.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;At SpotHero, we work as a team to empower people to get everywhere, easier! We’re rapidly growing with the mission of bringing the parking industry into the future through technology. Drivers across the nation use the SpotHero mobile app and website to reserve convenient, affordable parking in advance, on-the-go or through their connected cars, and parking companies rely on us to help them reach new customers while optimizing their business. We connect the dots with cutting-edge technology, delivering value to both sides of this exciting, evolving marketplace. We’ve been quite busy, take a peek at some of our recent&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://spothero.com/press/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;announcements&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Legal Operations Specialist/Senior Legal Operations Specialist:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SpotHero is looking for a Legal Operations Specialist to join our small, but mighty, Legal &amp;amp; Compliance Team and help grow this function within the SpotHero organization. This individual will have a proactive mindset with a bias towards action and an eagerness to step outside of their comfort zone to affect changes big and small. The Legal Operations Specialist will be an enthusiastic self-starter that values building relationships and working closely with individuals across the organization. In this role, you will&amp;nbsp; take the lead on developing, implementing, supporting and improving a number of processes, practices and systems that are (or will be) designed to improve our team’s efficiency, effectiveness, cost management and overall performance. This role will ultimately serve as the operational backbone of the Legal &amp;amp; Compliance Team and champion cross-functional efforts to provide legal and compliance support across SpotHero.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will be required to be present in the Chicago HQ office at least 1 day per week, subject to any future changes in company policy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help the Legal &amp;amp; Compliance Team identify opportunities for efficiency via automation and process development and standardization, and work closely with other business functions to implement process improvement.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with the Legal &amp;amp; Compliance Team to identify, develop, and project manage legal and compliance projects, such as developing processes around our templates and playbooks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a change management champion and help lead implementation, enablement and training for new tools and processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide financial management to the Legal &amp;amp; Compliance Team by processing invoices, monitoring budget constraints and actual performance against budget forecasts, as well as identifying spending trends, potential cost savings and efficiency opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strong relationships within the Legal &amp;amp; Compliance team, and other cross-functional stakeholders including Finance, IT, Revenue, Marketing and People.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current on industry best practice and leading legal department processes and influence continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and implement new tools and technology to support the team and the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the development and delivery of initiatives that promote collaboration and knowledge sharing (such as centralized / templated resources and processes).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Periodically benchmark Legal &amp;amp; Compliance Team operations, processes and practices against other legal departments, and identify opportunities for enhancement and improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tools you’ll be using:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contract management platform (Ironclad)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compliance platform (OneTrust)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Issue and Project Tracking Software (Jira/Confluence)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity management platform (Carta)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your voice, and your vision. Speak up, make big plans, form strong viewpoints based on data, and share them with the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Seeking Candidate in:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chicago, IL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you have&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s Degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter, with high integrity and ability to maintain confidentiality and discretion at all times&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of legal operations experience or 5+ years of operations experience and an interest in the legal field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented problem solver who works well in a team environment and has excellent communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work on several projects simultaneously with tight (but reasonable) deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to identify and implement process improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excited to work in a start-up environment and to grow with the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently, with appropriate oversight, as well as part of a team of attorneys and business professionals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with e-commerce or technology company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in or closely with an in-house legal team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project management certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in using Excel/Google Sheets/Google Docs/PowerPoint&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience utilizing tools like OneTrust, Carta, Ironclad, and Jira.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with e-billing systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
