&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Marketing Analyst at SpotHero:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SpotHero is seeking a Marketing Analyst to deliver data-driven decision support in our fast-paced and growing e-commerce marketplace. You&#39;ll join the Marketing Analytics team, whose work powers company-level CAC reporting, marketing mix modeling, and decisions across Marketing, Finance, Sales, CRM, and Customer Service — with coaching and support to keep developing your analytical and data-engineering skillset.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
