&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pricing Engineering Manager at SpotHero:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SpotHero is looking for an Engineering Manager to lead one of our key squads focused on pricing with the squad&#39;s vision to enable the best price possible for all locations on SpotHero. This is a hands-on leadership role for someone who loves going deep on technical challenges, thrives in building high-performing teams, and collaborates cross-functionally to deliver value at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll manage a full-stack engineering squad, partnering closely with Product to set direction, ship quality software, and drive team growth. You’ll be responsible for team health, delivery, and technical quality and you’ll be comfortable jumping into the code or managing incidents when needed.&lt;/p&gt;
